  "totalBlocks": 82,
  "translatedBlocks": 82,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "668727a700a2e2d4",
      "translationZh": "我们最近推出了一项功能，支持直接从 Amazon SageMaker Studio UI 在 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod EKS 集群上创建和管理 Amazon SageMaker Spaces。数据科学家和机器学习（ML）工程师现在无需离开浏览器或使用命令行工具，即可在 HyperPod 集群上启动 JupyterLab 和 Code Editor 环境，只需点击几下，就能从访问集群进入高效开发状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4332f75d3ebd087",
      "translationZh": "Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 提供专为大规模基础模型（FM）训练和推理构建的基础设施。借助 Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service（Amazon EKS）编排，团队可以在数百个加速器上运行分布式训练作业，并获得内置的弹性保障和自动故障恢复能力。除了训练之外，HyperPod 还将这一由 EKS 编排的基础设施扩展至推理服务，为拥有数十亿参数的基础模型提供低延迟、可扩展的推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9c4db34c5b1bd66",
      "translationZh": "今年早些时候，我们推出了 Amazon SageMaker Spaces for HyperPod，这是一款附加组件，ML 开发人员可以使用它直接在 HyperPod EKS 集群上创建交互式开发环境。此后，组织便可以在同一基础设施上，将交互式工作负载与训练作业和模型部署并行运行，从而最大限度地发挥 GPU 投资的价值，同时还支持分数 GPU 分配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96274bcebe451d1c",
      "translationZh": "此前，创建和管理 Spaces 主要依赖 HyperPod CLI 或 kubectl 命令。虽然这种方式为基础设施管理员提供了强大且细粒度的控制能力，但偏好可视化界面的数据科学家现在可以使用 SageMaker Studio 的这项新功能，绕过命令行工具，专注于模型开发。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7dd81930bcaa193b",
      "translationZh": "借助这项新功能，数据科学家现在可以直接从 SageMaker Studio 创建、配置、启动、停止和打开 Spaces。HyperPod 集群详情页上新增的 IDE and Notebooks 选项卡提供了完整的 Space 管理用户界面，使日常 Space 操作不再需要 CLI 工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0219b4a180c9248",
      "translationZh": "通过 Studio 可用的主要功能包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a974f27f8fc67b2",
      "translationZh": "通过引导式表单创建 Spaces，可配置计算资源、命名空间、存储、用于计算配额管理的 HyperPod Task Governance，以及镜像设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89dccf0c8bd537ac",
      "translationZh": "在可搜索的表格中查看所有 Spaces，表格显示名称、应用程序类型、状态、访问类型、存储，以及 GPU 和 vCPU 分配情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bc1e30944e1ad8a7",
      "translationZh": "只需一次选择即可启动和停止 Spaces，在不使用 Spaces 时释放计算资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb8ef3841ba696af",
      "translationZh": "直接在浏览器中打开 Spaces（JupyterLab 或 Code Editor），或通过您选择的远程 IDE（例如 VS Code）进行连接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c17ed4ca6e7cf52a",
      "translationZh": "图 1：HyperPod 集群详情页面上的 IDE and Notebooks 选项卡显示所有 Spaces 及其状态、计算资源分配，以及用于停止、打开或在远程 IDE 中打开的快捷操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e971c5f7405e887",
      "translationZh": "设置涉及两类角色：管理员负责准备集群，数据科学家负责创建和打开 Spaces。以下各节将分别介绍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cca07ec6d77358e",
      "translationZh": "管理员从其 SageMaker HyperPod EKS 集群的 IDE and Notebooks 选项卡中，使用 Quick install（采用优化的默认设置，一键安装）或 Custom install 选项（设置 Web UI 访问所必需），在 HyperPod EKS 集群上安装 SageMaker Spaces 附加组件。安装完成后，管理员可以配置命名空间、创建 Space 模板，并通过 EKS 访问条目管理访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e8e44be62dc9b50",
      "translationZh": "以下是管理员必须完成的一次性设置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "66c660c1e16d9249",
      "translationZh": "安装 Spaces 附加组件：在 Amazon SageMaker AI 控制台中打开您的 HyperPod 集群，转到 IDE and Notebooks 选项卡，然后选择 Quick install 或 Custom install（启用 Web 浏览器访问必须使用 Custom install）。完整说明请参阅 AWS 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f721566eef082748",
      "translationZh": "配置 EKS 访问条目：将 AmazonSagemakerHyperpodSpacePolicy、AmazonSagemakerHyperpodUserClusterPolicy 和 AmazonSagemakerHyperpodSpaceTemplatePolicy 这三个托管策略附加到数据科学家使用的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0647641612b559c8",
      "translationZh": "在 Studio 域上启用按用户身份传递：如果你的 Studio 域是在 SageMaker Studio 与 HyperPod Spaces 集成功能推出之前创建的，则必须启用向 HyperPod EKS 集群的按用户身份传递。这可确保每个 Studio 用户在集群上的操作（创建、停止或删除 Space）在 EKS 访问条目和 AWS CloudTrail 中归属于其用户配置文件。此外，这种身份映射会强制执行严格的 Space 所有权管理。它会跟踪哪个用户创建了环境，并确定该 Space 是私有的，还是在 SageMaker Studio 域内共享的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "809c3a6d713fb0c1",
      "translationZh": "对每个 Studio 域运行一次以下命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d063ed16274f604",
      "translationZh": "更新域后，验证以下命令是否返回“USER_IDENTITY”：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "068fdf975c79077e",
      "translationZh": "现有正在运行的应用不受影响。用户下次登录时，新设置将生效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35aec9555e560015",
      "translationZh": "按需开启其他功能：启用以下“可选功能”表中的任意功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cf463f85396759f",
      "translationZh": "安装附加组件并配置访问权限后，数据科学家可在 SageMaker Studio 的 Compute → HyperPod 下导航到自己的 HyperPod 集群，并选择 IDE and Notebooks 选项卡以查看 Spaces 管理界面（见图 1）。了解有关创建和管理 Spaces 的更多信息：在 HyperPod 上创建和管理 Spaces。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb4b613ce03b15e6",
      "translationZh": "当 Space 状态显示为 Running 后（在冷集群上通常需要几分钟，启用超额预配时约需 30–40 秒），选择 Open，在浏览器中启动 JupyterLab 或 Code Editor（图 2 和图 3）；或者选择 Open in VS Code，通过 SSH-over-SSM 从本地编辑器连接（图 4）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50f7cdac0265caba",
      "translationZh": "图 2：通过网页浏览器访问的 JupyterLab Space，展示了 Launcher，其中包含可用的笔记本内核、控制台和终端访问入口",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e85a2c88de197f03",
      "translationZh": "在 JupyterLab Space 中工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4b737228f90531e",
      "translationZh": "打开 JupyterLab Space 后，你会获得一个配置完备的开发环境，可以使用以下功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7607738eca7ecba9",
      "translationZh": "配备 ipykernel 的 Python 3 笔记本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05c32f6dd765d629",
      "translationZh": "Glue PySpark 和 Glue Spark 控制台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a89c77de9886a152",
      "translationZh": "SparkMagic PySpark 和 Spark 内核。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d625ef9824e42632",
      "translationZh": "用于运行命令的终端访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "65efde2613c10c88",
      "translationZh": "具有持久化存储的文件浏览器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f5314f3fc685904",
      "translationZh": "内置聊天和上下文帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2ce96607dfdf434",
      "translationZh": "你的工作内容会持久保存在挂载的 Amazon Elastic Block Store (Amazon EBS) 卷上，因此你可以停止并重新启动 Spaces，而不会丢失进度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a002c31ab06c5126",
      "translationZh": "图 3：在 HyperPod 上运行的 Code Editor Space，展示了 VS Code 风格的 Web 界面，其中包含文件资源管理器、编辑器和集成终端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3cca1f922cf1735a",
      "translationZh": "在 Code Editor Space 中工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bebb9b3bd1dafde3",
      "translationZh": "对于喜欢在浏览器中使用 VS Code 风格体验的开发者，Code Editor Spaces 提供了轻量级的 Web IDE，具备以下功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bca5b4aaf9832fe9",
      "translationZh": "完整的文件编辑功能，支持语法高亮和 IntelliSense。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b81e87b31fbb9a0",
      "translationZh": "集成终端，可用于运行 shell 命令、提交训练作业或与集群资源交互。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7ce66c28481804b",
      "translationZh": "扩展支持，可用于语言服务器、代码检查器和格式化工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a2139e869e13f7e",
      "translationZh": "Git 集成，支持版本控制工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "869630caeeff2ca3",
      "translationZh": "直接访问集群文件系统和已挂载的 Amazon FSx 卷。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e19f929d1bc14709",
      "translationZh": "Code Editor Spaces 非常适合编写和调试训练脚本、管理实验配置以及处理代码仓库，所有这些操作都无需离开浏览器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbb7d08db28c0555",
      "translationZh": "图 4：远程连接到 HyperPod Space 的本地 VS Code 实例，展示了远程连接指示器，以及在集群计算资源上运行的完整 IDE 功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "35baff9e853d983f",
      "translationZh": "远程 IDE 连接（VS Code）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2d8685535f7cdb3",
      "translationZh": "从 Spaces 表中选择 Open in VS Code，将本地 Visual Studio Code 连接到在 HyperPod 上运行的 Space。这在内部使用 SSH-over-SSM 隧道技术，可提供安全连接，而无需你管理 SSH 密钥或开放端口 22。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48320259d8aa5dfa",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用本地 VS Code 环境的全部强大功能，包括扩展、主题和快捷键绑定，同时在 HyperPod 集群计算资源上执行代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70457d5b2e773147",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用 AWS Toolkit for Visual Studio Code 进行连接，该工具会在 SageMaker AI > HyperPod 下列出你的 Spaces，你可以直接从工具包面板启动、停止和连接到 Spaces。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "09f2a63aff29d280",
      "translationZh": "可选功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d73457275c88bda5",
      "translationZh": "以下所有能力都是可选的，并且可以组合使用。启用任何符合团队需求的组合即可。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62e2269fce0cf918",
      "translationZh": "使用 AWS Application Load Balancer，并通过 Amazon Route 53 配置自定义 DNS，将浏览器流量路由到 Spaces。远程 IDE（通过 SSM 使用 VS Code）访问不需要这些配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6e459382fa83d9b",
      "translationZh": "由管理员定义的模板，可预先配置计算资源、镜像、存储和生命周期脚本，确保各团队的 Space 配置保持一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b36ddc736ddb5d82",
      "translationZh": "通过 Kueue 为多租户集群提供命名空间级别的计算资源配额、队列以及基于优先级的准入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9067aad8ac3fe712",
      "translationZh": "根据 Space 需求动态扩缩节点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26597bb279ed4561",
      "translationZh": "Karpenter 超额预置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0e48cc9b8ede326",
      "translationZh": "使用已预热且已预先拉取镜像的节点，将 Space 启动时间从 5–7 分钟缩短至约 30–40 秒。请参阅下方的专业提示部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c26aa24d48b211fe",
      "translationZh": "持久卷（EFS / FSx）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76a08d20dd7b4ff1",
      "translationZh": "跨 Spaces 持久保留的共享用户目录和团队数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ca7f220848c5bea",
      "translationZh": "将团队专用的运行时和库预置到托管在 Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) 中的容器镜像里。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e627d62aac57710d",
      "translationZh": "自动终止不活跃的 Spaces，防止计算成本失控。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec8597db7ab2d34c",
      "translationZh": "通过细粒度 GPU 分配，在 A100/H100 硬件上经济高效地运行交互式工作负载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7f1f2fc61d9b48e7",
      "translationZh": "实用技巧：通过节点超额预配置缩短 Space 启动时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05d0bb369d8b07f6",
      "translationZh": "默认情况下，在使用 Karpenter 自动扩缩容的 HyperPod EKS 集群上运行 SageMaker Spaces 时，首次在已缩容至零的集群上创建 Space 会产生 5–7 分钟的冷启动延迟，主要耗时来自：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b5e23bd1727a03c",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Elastic Compute cloud (Amazon EC2) 实例启动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "428ad81d56a746b9",
      "translationZh": "Kubernetes 节点注册。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33a319f62cdf3033",
      "translationZh": "拉取 SageMaker Distribution (SMD) 镜像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bc6dd9adf1bbcb4",
      "translationZh": "对于延迟敏感的交互式工作负载（JupyterLab、Code Editor），你可以使用标准的 Kubernetes 超额预配模式，维护一个已预热且缓存了镜像的节点池。这可将 Space 的启动时间从数分钟缩短到约 30–40 秒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb29c12cf2c9309e",
      "translationZh": "一个低优先级（-1000）的占位 Deployment 在每个预热节点上保留一个 Kubernetes pod。这些 pod 请求的 CPU/内存资源与实际 Space 相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fdfb9f1f6884a64e",
      "translationZh": "当 Karpenter 配置节点时，每个占位 pod 中的 initContainer 会提前将 SageMaker Distribution 镜像拉取到该节点上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f0cc30154f342b0e",
      "translationZh": "当用户创建 Space（默认优先级为 0）时，Kubernetes 调度器会抢占占位 pod（优先级为 -1000）。随后，Space 会在几秒内被调度到已预热且缓存了镜像的节点上，无需拉取镜像，也无需等待节点启动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a0294f3a2dbc3ec4",
      "translationZh": "Karpenter 会在后台为被挤出的占位 pod 配置一个替代节点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77e91204500a3d7a",
      "translationZh": "了解更多专业技巧的部署信息：HyperPod Spaces 的超额预配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fed79581a645c1cb",
      "translationZh": "使用大小约为 3.5 GB 的 sagemaker-distribution:latest-cpu SMD 镜像，在 ml.m5.12xlarge（可分配 24 vCPU，占位 pod 使用 2 vCPU 和 8 GiB 内存）上验证的启动延迟：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebf28c6ea76cd8cb",
      "translationZh": "Space 可与占位实例同时容纳（共存）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cf70b1a5269cb76",
      "translationZh": "Space 抢占占位实例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "449b4407521c131e",
      "translationZh": "冷启动（无预热池）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34dc20b517962fa8",
      "translationZh": "注意：这些数字仅适用于 CPU。GPU Spaces 需要单独的占位 Deployment，请求 nvidia.com/gpu 资源，并预先拉取 GPU 镜像。否则，GPU 节点仍处于冷状态，而且 GPU 镜像大小约为 10 GB，拉取成本远高于 3.5 GB 的 CPU 镜像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f647189a857aa2f3",
      "translationZh": "注意：每个预热节点都保有一个处于 Running 状态的 EC2 实例。对于按需节点，保持预热节点运行会产生额外成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ea6f40026f2ab32",
      "translationZh": "有关安装 HyperPod Spaces 附加组件和入门的更多信息，请参阅 AWS 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d82c94f0f5bec78",
      "translationZh": "配置 SageMaker Spaces 附加组件不会产生额外费用。您需要为 Spaces 消耗的底层 HyperPod 集群计算资源付费，并为用于 SSH-over-SSM 远程连接的 AWS Systems Manager Advanced On-Premises Instance 支付按小时计费的费用。详情请参阅 AWS Systems Manager 定价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f6bb36fa9a7468d",
      "translationZh": "如果您使用前文所述的超额预配方式，请注意，预热节点会产生额外成本。这些节点根据实例类型和大小保持运行状态，等待为 Spaces 进行预配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2a7574fc7bbcfa6",
      "translationZh": "使用 SageMaker Studio 管理 HyperPod Spaces，弥合了数据科学家与高性能计算基础设施之间的鸿沟。团队现在可以在几分钟内从访问集群过渡到运行 JupyterLab 或 Code Editor 环境，无需学习 CLI 工具或 Kubernetes 概念。结合 HyperPod Task Governance、GPU 份额支持和空闲时关闭等功能，组织可以为共享集群提供自助访问，同时保持成本控制和资源分配的公平性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2357ef17f0c35394",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用，请在 SageMaker AI 控制台中导航至您的 HyperPod EKS 集群，然后选择 IDE and Notebooks 选项卡。有关更多信息，请参阅 SageMaker HyperPod Spaces 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
